id: pm-80k965
title: "GH-1303: Canonical help and refreshable agent guidance"
description: Root and alias help use canonical invocations and mark deprecated aliases. Generated guidance uses atomic claim --start. Health detects stale managed guidance and supplies an idempotent refresh command.
