comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:11:04.745Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live all-status 2801-item inventory and request-specific searches found no owner for GH-1303. Reuse pm-mpbb and historical pm-ka6d. Report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1303"
  "2026-09-25T10:31:09.428Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: pre-change canonical-help and managed-guidance tests failed; after implementation the help, managed-guidance, init, merge-safety and integrity cohort passed 67 tests. Refresh preserves prose outside both managed blocks and a second invocation is a no-op. Health inspection remains read-only and advisory."
  "2026-09-25T10:51:19.818Z","harness:codex","Dogfood evidence: pm init --agent-guidance add refreshed this repository AGENTS.md to canonical atomic claiming and retained all surrounding operating rules. Handwritten CLAUDE.md remained unchanged. The eleven-step temporary CLI acceptance also verified read-only diagnostics, both managed targets, prose preservation and idempotent refresh."
  "2026-09-25T10:52:03.327Z","harness:codex","Additional onboarding observation: re-running init in an existing populated workspace still suggests Create your first item. Keep broader first-run setup work with canonical pm-z3ez and GitHub #1246; this delivery only refreshes managed guidance and its diagnostics. No duplicate feature was created."
  "2026-09-25T11:07:08.883Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: all four linked test commands passed sequentially with zero assertion failures or timeouts. Changed-source typecheck and ESLint pass. Hosted exact-head static and full coverage gates remain required before merge; prior full-run failure details were investigated and corrected without relaxing gates."
  "2026-09-25T11:28:49.832Z","harness:codex","PR #1307 review finding reproduced: a directory at AGENTS.md caused health to abort with EISDIR. Health now emits an advisory and still returns storage and other checks. The real-filesystem negative control failed before the change and passes afterward; touched function documentation was improved."
  "2026-09-25T11:31:35.610Z","harness:codex","PR #1307 first head f41e99e5ccb018bc9d69951b11dfa7e04f41a6bf passed all hosted checks, including full-source 100/100/100/100 coverage (CI run 36127818526). CodeRabbit findings were reproduced and fixed; all active linked test commands pass on the revision. New head review and required gates remain the merge boundary."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T10:29:48.805Z","harness:codex",Managed instruction freshness depends on generated content and the target project test command; comparing only marker versions misses content drift.
